title: The griffin
intro: Griff has a logo: a pixel-art griffin, in the editor and on every game it builds.
project: Platformer | Griffin Run

chapter: A griffin in the title bar
explain: logo | The logo | Griff has a logo now: a griffin's head, drawn as sixteen by sixteen pixel art.
say: At sixteen pixels every dot of the sprite is one pixel on screen, so it stays sharp in the title bar, on the taskbar and in Alt Tab.
say: It's the editor's own orange, and it wears it on the start page too.

chapter: Games wear it too | Build > Build Game
say: Games you build carry the griffin as their icon, so a jam entry looks finished from the moment it's downloaded.
build: standalone
say: The exe in the project's Build folder shows the griffin in Explorer, and on the taskbar while it plays.
